{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31348","headline":"重阳东观席上赠侍郎张固 · 卢顺之","name":"重阳东观席上赠侍郎张固","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渡江旌斾动鱼龙，令节开筵上碧峰。\n翡翠巢低岩桂小，茱萸房湿露香浓。\n白云郊外无尘事，黄菊筵中尽醉容。\n好是谢公高兴处，夕阳归骑出疎松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢顺之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}